flowchart TD
    Start([Authority: GET /v1/dataset/gateId/platformId/datasetId?subsetId=EU07]) --> AuthCheck[Authenticate & authorize\nrole=AUTHORITY required]

    AuthCheck --> ParseUIL[Parse UIL\ngateId, platformId, datasetId, subsetId]

    ParseUIL --> GateCheck{uil.gateId ==\nthis gate id?}

    GateCheck -->|Yes, local gate eu-xx01| LookupLocalPlatform[platformRegistry.get platformId\nLookup platform config in memory]
    GateCheck -->|No, remote gate eu-yy01| LookupRemoteGate[gateRegistry.get gateId]

    LookupLocalPlatform --> LocalPlatformFound{Platform found?}
    LocalPlatformFound -->|No| Return404P[Return 404\nPlatform not registered]
    LocalPlatformFound -->|Yes| CallLocalPlatform[HTTP GET platform.baseUrl\n/v1/datasets/datasetId?subsetId=EU07]

    LookupRemoteGate --> GateOnline{gate.status == ONLINE?}
    GateOnline -->|No: OFFLINE or DISABLED| Return502[Return 502 Bad Gateway\n"Cannot reach Gate eu-yy01: OFFLINE"]
    GateOnline -->|Yes| ForwardToRemote[Forward UILQuery to remote gate\neDelivery AS4 or Fast HTTP]

    ForwardToRemote --> RemoteGateResponse[Remote gate fetches from\nits local platform, returns response]

    RemoteGateResponse --> RemoteStatus{Response status?}
    RemoteStatus -->|200 OK| ReturnDataset[Return 200 OK with dataset XML\nX-Request-ID header echoed]
    RemoteStatus -->|403 Forbidden| Return403[Return 403 Forbidden\nplatform denied access]
    RemoteStatus -->|404 Not Found| Return404[Return 404 Not Found\ndataset expired or deleted]
    RemoteStatus -->|5xx Server Error| Return502b[Return 502 Bad Gateway\nplatform error]

    CallLocalPlatform --> LocalPlatformStatus{Platform response?}

    LocalPlatformStatus -->|200 OK| CheckSubsetting{platform.supportsSubsetting?}
    LocalPlatformStatus -->|403 Forbidden| Return403
    LocalPlatformStatus -->|404 Not Found| Return404
    LocalPlatformStatus -->|5xx / Timeout| Return502b

    CheckSubsetting -->|Yes| ReturnFilteredDataset[Return subset XML\nfiltered by platform]
    CheckSubsetting -->|No| ReturnFullDataset[Return full XML\ngate subsetter applies filtering]

    ReturnDataset --> End([Authority receives dataset])
    ReturnFilteredDataset --> End
    ReturnFullDataset --> End

    style Return502 fill:#f99,stroke:#900
    style Return502b fill:#f99,stroke:#900
    style Return403 fill:#faa,stroke:#900
    style Return404 fill:#fda,stroke:#960
    style Return404P fill:#fda,stroke:#960
    style ReturnDataset fill:#9f9,stroke:#060
    style ReturnFilteredDataset fill:#9f9,stroke:#060
    style ReturnFullDataset fill:#9f9,stroke:#060
